[{"title":"梳妆台","author":"慕昌溎","text":"金国萧条万事非，妆台犹说李宸妃。\n芳尘无复凌波步，霞绮还疑旧舞衣。\n细雨禁城花自落，疏钟太液燕空飞。\n雕栏玉砌春长在，应有香魂月下归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28690,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏读书杂咏 其一","author":"慕昌溎","text":"湿云蒸落日，雨气润流黄。\n好风时入户，飒然生微凉。\n晚花红堕砌，幽草弄馀芳。\n芸编间披览，虚室澹生香。\n虽惭管窥豹，得失亦评量。\n聊资耳目异，安问兴与亡。\n好鸟已复鸣，相对更举觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28691,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏读书杂咏 其二","author":"慕昌溎","text":"深谷有枯草，阳崖茂嘉卉。\n兹岂物性殊，植高禀气异。\n巍巍卫、霍勋，赫赫椒房势。\n襁褓皆列侯，枝附尽高位。\n功成正少年，天幸易为致。\n谁识故将军，吞声霸陵尉。\n简子叹雀雉，其意殊堪嘲。\n初质犹不保，化生亦徒劳。\n如何秦、汉世，妄意希松乔。\n苍生力已尽，方士气正骄。\n秦女去不返，三山终迢遥。\n废书仰天叹，浮云开碧霄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28692,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉","author":"慕昌溎","text":"避暑池塘雨乍收，芰荷香暗绿阴稠。\n松间老鹤眠初觉，水底疏星影乱流。\n夜月虚明辉万户，银河清浅入新秋。\n好逢八月浮槎至，泛向天边访女牛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28693,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昆仑奴歌","author":"慕昌溎","text":"飞宇连云列阿阁，相公卧病垂珠箔。\n中有佳人颦翠蛾，春愁暗逐炉烟结。\n千牛省疾乍登堂，杨柳风姿何濯濯。\n酪湩虽甘桃液酸，幽怀脉脉言不得。\n临别殷勤覆玉纤，含情空指胸前月。\n不教磨勒解疑团，月满良宵应独看。\n力士金椎挝猛犬，雕栏已失护花幡。\n逐得渔船辞洞口，一肩香雪度重垣。\n嗟嗟人奴技至此，惜哉未遇汉天子。\n戈盾林中如鸟飞，汾阳失策复何悔。\n安、史虽灭外夷强，胡不使之执鞭弭。\n他年翠辇再蒙尘，空令卖药洛阳市。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28694,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行遇雨","author":"慕昌溎","text":"惊风挟急雨，飒沓千山昏。\n黑云塞天地，陵谷茫不分。\n客子迷故路，四顾惊心魂。\n奇峰阻我前，何以回车辕。\n行行且复上，瘦马凌巑岏。\n砰訇走涧石，冻瀑如雷奔。\n轻冰结衣襟，山气厉严寒。\n远游意良苦，悲彼《行路难》。\n日暮念故乡，东望空长叹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28695,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"度韩侯岭","author":"慕昌溎","text":"径仄劳车马，崎岖鸟道蟠。\n高皇无寸土，孤岭尚名韩。\n风劲汾流急，峰尖石剑攒。\n何须凌绝顶，转恐下山难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28696,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中条山吊司空表圣","author":"慕昌溎","text":"落日寒无影，层云万里阴。\n诗人不可见，霜叶一山深。\n堕笏非嘉遁，成仁悲陆沈。\n清风谁许并，遥对首阳岑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28697,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潼关行","author":"慕昌溎","text":"东走黄河西华山，屹然当险开潼关。\n雉堞高插青云端，一夫坚守称万全。\n桃林战士二十万，谁致死之歌舒翰。\n三秦流血膏胡锋，长蛇封豕蟠关中。\n銮舆播荡身降虏，勋名百战皆成空。\n哥舒失机诚自辱，悲哉胜朝孙白谷。\n慷慨临关血战频，孤忠卒难撑全局。\n朝廷政事伤陵夷，乾坤坐令烟尘飞。\n譬如全体皆已失，咽喉虽存将安为。\n是知在德不在险，吁嗟关兮空崔巍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28698,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"太华山闻钟","author":"慕昌溎","text":"太华新晴宿雨收，清钟遥度夜天幽。\n一声初动三峰迥，万籁都沈孤月秋。\n天外微传玄鹤唳，树间时见碧云流。\n松风飒起馀音杳，霜气横空失斗牛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28699,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望终南","author":"慕昌溎","text":"终南晴后势崔鬼，积雪皑皑万壑堆。\n天外奇峰连日白，山头老树尽花开。\n惊风摧木号阴岭，冻瀑挟冰走涧雷。\n晓起长安排闼望，岚光如水入城来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28700,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中游曲江","author":"慕昌溎","text":"一天疏雨且衔杯，寒食寻芳曲水隈。\n江燕低随飞絮下，春帆閒逐落花来。\n沙蟠细草萦青带，风卷轻波泻绿醅。\n回首当年修禊事，兰亭诵罢更徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28701,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"霸桥","author":"慕昌溎","text":"几株新绿雨冥冥，玉笛吹来隔岸听。\n柳色不知前代改，春来还向霸桥青。\n初添弱线萦烟水，送尽行人过短亭。\n最是夜深离别处，一林残月酒初醒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28702,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送春","author":"慕昌溎","text":"春光此去欲何之，好向东风问后期。\n币地绿阴啼鸟换，满庭风絮卷帘时。\n遥看别路云千叠，且尽临歧酒一卮。\n祇有落花不辞远，多情直送到天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28703,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读神仙传有感","author":"慕昌溎","text":"封禅祈灵海上游，几人曾得到瀛洲。\n紫芝东采三山远，青鸟西飞五利愁。\n终古玉关秦月在，祇今汾水汉云秋。\n剧怜仙李蟠根大，圣祖俨然御冕旒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28704,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"倚楼","author":"慕昌溎","text":"远岫明楼角，扶疏草木幽。\n坐来微雨歇，山气澹如秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28705,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜闻西风大起有怀文波四妹","author":"慕昌溎","text":"西风飒然至，万树动秋声。\n怀汝不成寐，长歌空复情。\n愿言生两翼，乘此便东征。\n细语别来事，宵深酒共倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28706,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"左太冲咏史","author":"慕昌溎","text":"赫赫金、张势，朱紫荣襁褓。\n峨峨许、史庐，高台连曲沼。\n扬雄独不达，著书摅怀抱。\n伟哉身后名，文章传八表。\n倚桐始生时，见困于蒿草。\n及其凌云霓，倾枝巢凤鸟。\n奇材有迍邅，天命苦不早。\n鲲鹏异鸴鸠，知年有大小。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28707,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谢灵运游山","author":"慕昌溎","text":"弱冠怀微尚，复与世相逐。\n违志兹二纪，谢病返初服。\n寻异淹晨昏，赏心穷水陆。\n层岩备登顿，平林恣远瞩。\n阳葩相映蔚，幽草亦芬馥。\n微雨过春江，蒲稗生新绿。\n水流虑自澹，山深人绝俗。\n行从太公任，朅伐谢林木。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28708,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杜子美出塞","author":"慕昌溎","text":"含凄别亲故，驱马度塞垣。\n惊风撼阴海，大雪压龙山。\n胡天云气恶，我行何时还。\n朝廷方勤远，壮士敢顾身。\n所怜多死亡，何以答吾君。\n男儿即戎事，报国当及辰。\n荣名患不立，成败何足论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28709,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"韦应物访友","author":"慕昌溎","text":"言访摄生客，持榼披云树。\n采药犹未归，一鸟烟中度。\n怅望碧云深，幽人渺何处。\n日暮雨萧萧，独下寒山去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28710,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别亲 其一","author":"慕昌溎","text":"祈招兴咏幸三思，叔世陵夷亦可悲。\n门户已开闽蜀洛，坡公端不合时宜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28711,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别亲 其二","author":"慕昌溎","text":"伯道无儿真恨事，中郎有女剧堪怜。\n淮阴易帜原良策，急为相攸慰九泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28712,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别亲 其三","author":"慕昌溎","text":"谢却尘缘俗累纷，独伤白首负辛勤。\n此心难使幽明间，泉下还将望白云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28713,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别亲 其四","author":"慕昌溎","text":"幻影浮沤廿八年，庭闱别处转凄然。\n聪明根蒂如留得，不向他生再种缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28714,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝笔","author":"慕昌溎","text":"雨中杜宇啼，溅尽一腔血。\n莫化断肠花，肝肠已断绝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28715,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆母","author":"谢佩珊","text":"钗裙犹未改，作妇岂忘箴。\n勉遂阿姑意，恐劳慈母心。\n晨昏知礼拙，教养念恩深。\n谁谓归宁好，翻教泪满襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28716,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望外信久不至","author":"谢漱馨","text":"人去天涯远，鱼缄竟渺茫。\n春闺添怅望，旅舍谅安康。\n岂是音书少，知因道路长。\n遥思游子意，魂梦早还乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28717,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春暮","author":"萧道管","text":"春暮花飞尽，无人寂闭门。\n满庭苔草色，诗思在黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28718,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"窗前树金银花一架","author":"萧道管","text":"酴醾香梦何匆匆，花散天女褪紫红。\n天然金玉抱奇相，锦绣照耀谢化工。\n美人薄采不盈掬，宜田待女怨东风。\n烟携雪挺搴素袂，淡黄深白摇绮栊。\n低垂蕙帐悄然觉，蘅芜恍惚把芳丛。\n残蜂倦蝶不到处，无衣妆额尤玲珑。\n美人何日不成虹，白云黄竹逢西东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28719,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"萧道管","text":"薄帷淡如烟，春阴浓于墨。\n窗前倚复倚，稍觉寒恻恻。\n顾兹瓶中花，倍有销魂色。\n因思成小筑，万本会香国。\n南轩坐管领，红紫面皆北。\n太阴有炼形，暄妍未为得。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28720,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕杂诗仿曝书亭体 其一","author":"萧道管","text":"定有琼楼特地凉，银河烂熳起红墙。\n黄姑曝惯黄绵袄，不领天孙云锦裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28721,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕杂诗仿曝书亭体 其二","author":"萧道管","text":"西风不算清凉伞，南阮无多黄竹箱。\n拥得桃笙背镫坐，月痕如水过东墙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28722,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕杂诗仿曝书亭体 其三","author":"萧道管","text":"碧海青天几度来，婿乡缥缈指蓬莱。\n嫦娥懒见双星会，渐渐灵妃唤不回。\n依旧东西沟水流，有人为古起担忧。\n玉皇不付冯暖券，何处婚钱醵阮修。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28723,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕杂诗仿曝书亭体 其四","author":"萧道管","text":"秋声不起青杨巷，夜色平分黄篾楼。\n晒罢残书无个事，诗情伫到个萤流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28724,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西郊上冢即目 其一","author":"萧道管","text":"荠麦东风绿，菜花斜日黄。\n郊原好颜色，生色上衣裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28725,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西郊上冢即目 其二","author":"萧道管","text":"梨花零落尽，独有豆花肥。\n多谢东风意，微香吹扑衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28726,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西郊上冢即目 其三","author":"萧道管","text":"水田真漠漠，雨后少人耕。\n白鹭不飞去，相随立复行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28727,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"萧道管","text":"下帘划袜移，萧寥夜又冷。\n窗纱厌白地，位以瓶花影。\n微风尔何来，欺我炉烟挺。\n昔年两无寐，索句银烛秉。\n画屏看双星，娇宠形影并。\n无眠更延伫，钗划月痕等。\n良夜去迢迢，有如兰釭耿。\n与君复此夕，静味当细领。\n宿雨响不停，谯楼静而迥。\n独怜栖鸟惊，踏踏怯寒梗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28728,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"萧道管","text":"桔槔声里月如烟，危栏虚倚愁不眠。\n梦魂飞越路三千，碧云楼阁何处边。\n下有清影照㛹娟，亭亭隐约画廊前。\n此时幽怨鬓斜偏，紫霄鸾凤乘何缘。\n西风写韵传一篇，不然湖色西子妍。\n波纹滑笏如春笺，飘零风露共叩舷。\n云鬟香雾湿可怜，弃掷宝枕梦游仙。\n销歇锦瑟张鹍弦，胡为落叶听哀蝉。\n蘧蘧蝴蝶去不还，秋更一一年复年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28729,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙华镇看桃花","author":"萧道管","text":"龙华桃花十五里，桃花红白玫瑰紫。\n游人看花兼看人，马如游龙车如水。\n罥枝裙衩香春风，映肉花光一何绮。\n游人只恐斜阳暮，照影争怜绿波美。\n长安水边不可见，湖西花钿只如此。\n明朝处处卖花声，苦报春光疾如驶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28730,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暑晚得雨","author":"萧道管","text":"疏雨洒池竹，雨斜竹已垂。\n继以微风度，门馆生凉时。\n细点湿窗纸，馀飔飏书帷。\n瓶花如新润，炉烟惟清丝。\n于焉遂延伫，数语不成诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28731,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晚 其一","author":"萧道管","text":"蝉声摇曳歇，庭院晚凉留。\n衫袖风添裥，帘栊月当钩。\n竹香秋梦碎，树影夕阳收。\n亦是诗家语，谁能刻意求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28732,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晚 其二","author":"萧道管","text":"微月澹空庭，薄云天际青。\n鸣蛩犹阁阁，瘦蝶已星星。\n曲院蕉疑雨，疏窗镫似萤。\n江潮少焉至，荻叶最堪听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28733,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偕大姊晚眺","author":"姚倚云","text":"何处钟声逐晚风，碧天云净夕阳红。\n渔人隔岸弄明月，白鹭衔鱼出柳丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28734,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕和三弟","author":"姚倚云","text":"骨肉得为乐，聚散良有已。\n除夕荐芳尊，相对如梦里。\n承欢白发前，绕膝孙曾喜。\n侧听爆竹喧，坐待晨光紫。\n但恐开岁来，复作远游子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28735,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安福闻子规寄怀大姊","author":"姚倚云","text":"高柳依廊疏影低，碧天清夜子规啼。\n无端惆怅思千里，双桂楼前月向西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28736,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和夫子","author":"姚倚云","text":"文章浩浩古人长，快意雄风忆大王。\n黄鹄不知天地远，黑貂应觉雪霜凉。\n樽前丘壑资谈笑，眼底江山起病尪。\n隔岁离愁定无限，只今且复为君强。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28737,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"用欧公韵寄夫子","author":"姚倚云","text":"忆昨送君时，风光正春日。\n别离那可论，此心良忽忽。\n虽有千万言，心悲不能出。\n深恐扰君思，回肠忍泪没。\n自君远行役，承欢双亲膝。\n黾勉敢惮劳，夙夜怀懔慄。\n初来未尽谙，儿女相辅弼。\n惭惶提斯心，安得往时逸。\n风月非无趣，每每看令失。\n时或有佳致，十不能得一。\n感念高堂慈，遇事必宽恤。\n有时怜其长，命之和新律。\n亦欲博亲欢，苦思真咄咄。\n流光何迅速，夏去秋风疾。\n相思惟自知，乌能向人述。\n忽得桐城书，青山已卜吉。\n览之涕交流，岂敢望归必。\n老人竟颔首，许其返蓬筚。\n又得津门书，周旋语意密。\n极论劬劳恩，去日若鞭抶。\n汝心苟不从，遗恨当斧锧。\n故尔辞两亲，脱身不用乞。\n在道感君怀，反复视君笔。\n忧思安能已，徒有泪横溢。\n君诚不自聊，尚恐君心郁。\n何以报深情，珍重为君匹。\n倦极入幽梦，相见在仿佛。\n忽为晨钟醒，劳生待谁嫉。\n茫茫大块中，尔我定何物。\n好留泡影嬉，祇待白头毕。\n从兄复登舟，亦任风涛䫻。\n万里若乘槎，苍茫近太乙。\n云际山迢迢，枫林秋瑟瑟。\n寒沙群雁嗷，荒渚幽虫唧。\n皓月一周天，片帆抵官室。\n悲喜涕重闱，亲情绕诸侄。\n旧日闺阁中，妆台尽散佚。\n芙蓉尚含苞，丹橘犹结实。\n依依我亲傍，留连复惕怵。\n聊慰罔极思，寸心中自劾。\n且复爱年华，新妆待君栉。\n翱翔好致身，憔悴嗟吾质。\n不然陶翟耳，吾岂慕高秩。\n堂上七十年，人情三百绂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28738,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送豫生七姑北上","author":"聂炳楠","text":"重碧轻斟尽一觞，柳丝无力绾离肠。\n长安西笑谁言乐，江水深愁未可量。\n眉妩待传京兆笔，诗怀应满野云囊。\n县知燕草明年绿，定忆家山苦笋香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28739,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游山同翰君作","author":"吴怡","text":"落日陀台畔，晴空一雁飞。\n平芜迷望远，野鸟向人低。\n金井凄寒缏，秋砧捣客衣。\n故园松菊好，三径愿同归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28740,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕示翰君","author":"吴怡","text":"画屏无睡怯新凉，秋点听残夜未央。\n耿耿银河望灵匹，娟娟素月照流黄。\n星盟钿盒应珍重，石赠支机事渺茫。\n为恐良时容易尽，绿章愿乞此宵长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28741,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答姊病中秋感示扁善","author":"吴怡","text":"小山丛桂暗香浮，极目平芜起莫愁。\n示疾维摩时恋榻，倦游王粲怯登楼。\n身如客燕仍为客，心似秋桐易感秋。\n何日莼鲈遂归思，五湖偕隐狎閒鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28742,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕前一日独坐简扁善","author":"吴怡","text":"月影移花度绮寮，帘垂银蒜夜迢迢。\n秋萤吸雾栖烟叶，凉露侵人湿翠翘。\n小别漫栽红豆子，閒情且倚紫琼箫。\n双星漠漠秋河澹，睡鸭馀薰已半消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28743,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和家大人上巳日作","author":"吴怡","text":"微雨帘笼燕影斜，博山香细透轻纱。\n春阴十日朱成碧，幽恨频年鬓欲华。\n漫学参军作蛮语，且持樽酒饯飞花。\n比来客思颓唐甚，懒逐游人斗钿车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28744,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日登越秀山和家大人步东坡惠州韵","author":"吴怡","text":"海门日落角声凉，庾岭霜清橘柚香。\n几处寒砧催木叶，频年倦旅怯秋光。\n登临朝汉荒台畔，凭吊降王废苑傍。\n莫问当时歌舞地，暮云愁锁绿芜长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28745,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日越秀山怀古 其一","author":"吴怡","text":"苍茫吊古独登台，极目天南瘴雾开。\n一代兴亡悲黍麦，千秋霸业剩蒿莱。\n塍荒禁苑耕残瓦，潮落珠江冷劫灰。\n回首玉钩斜畔路，素馨寂寞销寒晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28746,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日越秀山怀古 其二","author":"吴怡","text":"落日秋原草木彫，断垣残础认前朝。\n呼鸾道废佳游歇，戏马台荒霸气销。\n岭海蛮烟愁陆贾，陀城瘴雨吊任嚣。\n登临不尽沧桑感，怕听西风咽暮涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28747,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和沈季文壬子除夕感怀诗元韵同翰君作","author":"吴怡","text":"岁去无踪杳莫寻，百壶春酒且重斟。\n丹颜绿鬓随年改，密咏恬吟坐夜深。\n六合之中皆寄旅，一杯以外听浮沈。\n纷纷时局方争鹿，漫诩河山似带襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28748,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感","author":"王嗣晖","text":"瑟瑟江头枫树丹，芦花吹尽笛声残。\n愁经病后心逾淡，诗入秋天意更寒。\n断续繁砧催野渡，萧疏木叶响雕栏。\n乱山叠叠斜阳里，剩有归鸿天际看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28749,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明妃","author":"王嗣晖","text":"雁声催向玉门关，一曲琵琶马上閒。\n回首汉宫三十六，独留明月照朱颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28750,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]